[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4563.11, "timestamp": "01:16:03", "text": "嗯，你覺得呢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4581.03, "timestamp": "01:16:21", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4583.43, "timestamp": "01:16:23", "text": "是門。他們不應該嗎？我的天哪。我的天啊。我的天啊。  我們有辦法提升自己。我再也不需要性了。  是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4599.35, "timestamp": "01:16:39", "text": "這是在調情。  是的。  我可以在這裡畫一個像漂浮圓盤一樣的東西嗎？可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4607.189, "timestamp": "01:16:47", "text": "真有意思"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4613.99, "timestamp": "01:16:53", "text": "，你變出一張光碟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4615.59, "timestamp": "01:16:55", "text": "。"}]